#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_multiple_parts.rst:5
msgid "Select multiple parts"
msgstr "选择多个部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_multiple_parts.rst:7
msgid ""
"As many CAD tools, many `parts`_ (`Line`_, `Rectangle`_, `Ellipse`_, `Arc`_,"
" `Polygon`_, `Terminal`_, `text`_ and `dynamic text field`_) from "
"`workspace`_ can be selected at the same time."
msgstr ""
"与许多 CAD 工具一样，可以同时选择 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中的多个 `部件 <parts_>`_ （`线条 "
"<Line_>`_、`矩形 <Rectangle_>`_、`椭圆 <Ellipse_>`_、`圆弧 <Arc_>`_、`多边形 "
"<Polygon_>`_、`端子 <Terminal_>`_、`文本 <text_>`_ 和 `动态文本字段 <dynamic text "
"field_>`_ ）。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_multiple_parts.rst:12
msgid "Select multiple objects using keyboard and mouse"
msgstr "使用键盘和鼠标选择多个对象"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_multiple_parts.rst:14
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows selecting multiple `parts`_ from the `workspace`_ "
"combining the use of the keyboard and mouse."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许结合使用键盘和鼠标，从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中选择多个 `部件 <parts_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_multiple_parts.rst:16
msgid "`Select`_ the first `part`_."
msgstr "`选择 <Select_>`_ 第一个 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_multiple_parts.rst:17
msgid "Press ``Ctrl``."
msgstr "按住 ``Ctrl`` 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_multiple_parts.rst:18
msgid "`Select`_ the rest of `parts`_ without releasing ``Ctrl``."
msgstr "保持按住 ``Ctrl`` ，再 `选择 <Select_>`_ 其余的 `部件 <parts_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_multiple_parts.rst:23
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech schema"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 原理图"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_multiple_parts.rst:26
msgid "Select multiple objects by selecting area"
msgstr "通过框选区域选择多个对象"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_multiple_parts.rst:28
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows selecting all `parts`_ from a defined area using the "
"mouse."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许使用鼠标选择指定区域内的所有 `部件 <parts_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_multiple_parts.rst:30
msgid ""
"Left click on the initial point from the rectangular area to be selected and"
" displace the mouse without releasing the button."
msgstr "在要选择的矩形区域的起点点击左键，然后按住左键拖动鼠标。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_multiple_parts.rst:35
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech selecting on workspace"
msgstr "图：在 QElectroTech 工作区中选择"
